  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Initiation Plan aims to outline a comprehensive initiative for the Chittagong Hill Tracts (CHT). This programme coordinates three distinct yet interconnected projects, with separate funding sources, that collectively address key areas including empowering girls and women through inclusive access to education and skills, addressing climate change issues, ecosystem restoration, biodiversity conservation, livelihood improvement, supporting youth on climate change, nature-based solution, climat</narrative>
